#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:184 940974e74eae4574be7c5f5fecdc6263
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:186 e6b3c76a91da441da5d372537cd8cff4
msgid ""
"This module embeds [LuaJIT 2.0/2.1](https://luajit.org/luajit.html) into "
"Nginx. It is a core component of [OpenResty](https://openresty.org). If "
"you are using this module, then you are essentially using OpenResty."
msgstr ""
"本模块把 [LuaJIT 2.0/2.1](https://luajit.org/luajit.html) 嵌入 Nginx。它是 "
"[OpenResty](https://openresty.org) 的核心组件。如果你在使用这个模块，那么你本质上就是在使用 "
"OpenResty。"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:190 eeb5999e5f384a9faa6b9dcbbf2ed905
msgid ""
"Since version `v0.10.16` of this module, the standard Lua interpreter "
"(also known as \"PUC-Rio Lua\") is not supported anymore. This document "
"interchangeably uses the terms \"Lua\" and \"LuaJIT\" to refer to the "
"LuaJIT interpreter."
msgstr ""
"自本模块 `v0.10.16` 起，标准 Lua 解释器（也称 “PUC-Rio Lua”）不再受支持。本文档交替使用 “Lua” 和 "
"“LuaJIT” 两个词，都指 LuaJIT 解释器。"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:195 81b7f32369644390bb26a38b332eeb75
msgid ""
"By leveraging Nginx's subrequests, this module allows the integration of "
"the powerful Lua threads (known as Lua \"coroutines\") into the Nginx "
"event model."
msgstr "通过利用 Nginx 的子请求，本模块可将强大的 Lua 线程（即 Lua “协程”）集成进 Nginx 事件模型。"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:198 cfbfe43a6dab418994a214eea47331ab
msgid ""
"Unlike [Apache's "
"mod_lua](https://httpd.apache.org/docs/trunk/mod/mod_lua.html) and "
"[Lighttpd's "
"mod_magnet](http://redmine.lighttpd.net/wiki/1/Docs:ModMagnet), Lua code "
"executed using this module can be *100% non-blocking* on network traffic "
"as long as the [Nginx API for Lua](#nginx-api-for-lua) provided by this "
"module is used to handle requests to upstream services such as MySQL, "
"PostgreSQL, Memcached, Redis, or upstream HTTP web services."
msgstr ""
"与 [Apache 的 "
"mod_lua](https://httpd.apache.org/docs/trunk/mod/mod_lua.html) 和 "
"[Lighttpd 的 "
"mod_magnet](http://redmine.lighttpd.net/wiki/1/Docs:ModMagnet) "
"不同，只要使用本模块提供的 [Nginx API for Lua](#nginx-api-for-lua) 来处理对 "
"MySQL、PostgreSQL、Memcached、Redis 或上游 HTTP Web 服务等上游服务的请求，用本模块执行的 Lua "
"代码在网络流量上就可以做到 *100% 非阻塞*。"

