#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:225 731a7e612c29445d9b2c09591ae292bf
msgid ""
"Almost any Nginx modules can be used with this ngx_lua module by means of"
" [ngx.location.capture](#ngxlocationcapture) or "
"[ngx.location.capture_multi](#ngxlocationcapture_multi) but it is "
"recommended to use those `lua-resty-*` libraries instead of creating "
"subrequests to access the Nginx upstream modules because the former is "
"usually much more flexible and memory-efficient."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:232 f674e11f96064b37bb134e0efdb10077
msgid ""
"The Lua interpreter (also known as \"Lua State\" or \"LuaJIT VM "
"instance\") is shared across all the requests in a single Nginx worker "
"process to minimize memory use. Request contexts are segregated using "
"lightweight Lua coroutines."
msgstr ""
"Lua 解释器（也称 “Lua State” 或 “LuaJIT VM instance”）在单个 Nginx worker "
"进程的所有请求之间共享，以最小化内存占用。请求上下文通过轻量级 Lua 协程相互隔离。"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:236 03d89a2d7ad14007a778cadd214ceaed
msgid ""
"Loaded Lua modules persist in the Nginx worker process level resulting in"
" a small memory footprint in Lua even when under heavy loads."
msgstr "已加载的 Lua 模块在 Nginx worker 进程级别常驻，即使在高负载下也能保持很小的 Lua 内存占用。"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:239 e95d44bf7dd942b687a0470f7e0ea35f
msgid ""
"This module is plugged into Nginx's \"http\" subsystem so it can only "
"speak downstream communication protocols in the HTTP family (HTTP "
"0.9/1.0/1.1/2.0, WebSockets, etc...).  If you want to do generic TCP "
"communications with the downstream clients, then you should use the "
"[ngx_stream_lua](https://github.com/openresty/stream-lua-nginx-"
"module#readme) module instead, which offers a compatible Lua API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:248 fd0eaf6278e44e7c9652f77bd834d590
msgid "Typical Uses"
msgstr "典型用途"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:250 fd7d6d0ac3084df4a8ecd4a7eb8b7605
msgid "Just to name a few:"
msgstr "仅举几例："

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:252 6a0647ed400f467ab34f2bebc4f3dc7f
msgid ""
"Mashup'ing and processing outputs of various Nginx upstream outputs "
"(proxy, drizzle, postgres, redis, memcached, etc.) in Lua,"
msgstr "在 Lua 中聚合并处理各种 Nginx 上游的输出（proxy、drizzle、postgres、redis、memcached 等），"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:253 197aef3c39c24898ae530302c5c68af0
msgid ""
"doing arbitrarily complex access control and security checks in Lua "
"before requests actually reach the upstream backends,"
msgstr "在请求真正到达上游后端之前，用 Lua 做任意复杂的访问控制与安全检查，"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:254 539e28c6b7754551a2f65ccaacaefb89
msgid "manipulating response headers in an arbitrary way (by Lua)"
msgstr "用 Lua 以任意方式修改响应头"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:255 5053b70b01ad48b199ccc7a93851eb65
msgid ""
"fetching backend information from external storage backends (like redis, "
"memcached, mysql, postgresql) and use that information to choose which "
"upstream backend to access on-the-fly,"
msgstr "从外部存储后端（如 redis、memcached、mysql、postgresql）获取后端信息，并据此实时选择要访问哪个上游后端，"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:256 fefd062adb00411088463c9f18d9880b
msgid ""
"coding up arbitrarily complex web applications in a content handler using"
" synchronous but still non-blocking access to the database backends and "
"other storage,"
msgstr "在内容处理器中编写任意复杂的 Web 应用，以同步但仍然非阻塞的方式访问数据库后端和其他存储，"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:257 7570bcda782a4d60a08570a8c56d07d3
msgid "doing very complex URL dispatch in Lua at rewrite phase,"
msgstr "在 rewrite 阶段用 Lua 做非常复杂的 URL 分发，"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:258 a0483f59f7ef4f168c2aff3d8ab4eab1
msgid ""
"using Lua to implement advanced caching mechanism for Nginx's subrequests"
" and arbitrary locations."
msgstr "用 Lua 为 Nginx 的子请求和任意 location 实现高级缓存机制。"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:260 24372a1a6e984ab8b9de82eacb5a93a4
msgid ""
"The possibilities are unlimited as the module allows bringing together "
"various elements within Nginx as well as exposing the power of the Lua "
"language to the user. The module provides the full flexibility of "
"scripting while offering performance levels comparable with native C "
"language programs both in terms of CPU time as well as memory footprint "
"thanks to LuaJIT 2.x."
msgstr ""
"由于该模块能把 Nginx 内部的各个要素组合在一起，并向用户展示 Lua 语言的能力，其可能性是无限的。得益于 LuaJIT "
"2.x，该模块既提供了脚本化的全部灵活性，又在 CPU 时间和内存占用上提供了与原生 C 语言程序相当的性能。"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:266 9c45e4c0efbc470bbed940b53fde2638
msgid ""
"Other scripting language implementations typically struggle to match this"
" performance level."
msgstr "其他脚本语言实现通常难以达到这一性能水平。"

