"[default_type](https://nginx.org/en/docs/http/ngx_http_core_module.html#default_type)"
" directive for the default value of the `Content-Type` response header. "
"Deactivate this directive if a default `Content-Type` response header for"
" Lua request handlers is not desired."
msgstr ""

