msgstr "**语法**：*precontent_by_lua_block { lua-script }*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:1783 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:1821
#: 191693bd45d44b5ba25a0a6629cd7552 942c22068f7d4854a3c96767a1e5fd30
