#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:2999 53122486286246e28e1aa548e5a9a644
msgid ""
"This directive runs Lua code to look up and load the SSL session (if any)"
" according to the session ID provided by the current SSL handshake "
"request for the downstream."
msgstr ""

