msgid ""
"This directive controls the default timeout value used in TCP/unix-domain"
" socket object's [receive](#tcpsockreceive) method and iterator functions"
" returned by the [receiveuntil](#tcpsockreceiveuntil) method. This "
"setting can be overridden by the [settimeout](#tcpsocksettimeout) or "
"[settimeouts](#tcpsocksettimeouts) methods."
