msgid "lua_sa_restart"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3774 ca5ed3beb54d426f8c9aeabc80e7e3b4
msgid "**syntax:** *lua_sa_restart on|off*"
msgstr "**语法**：*lua_sa_restart on|off*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3776 7f54a0756e9445bcafaa471b9fa83d26
msgid "**default:** *lua_sa_restart on*"
msgstr "**默认**：*lua_sa_restart on*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3780 fff0a6dab35e417b888a0a35af086727
msgid ""
"When enabled, this module will set the `SA_RESTART` flag on Nginx workers"
" signal dispositions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3782 3babab9e4e684f4bb60ba0e3f470ba31
msgid ""
"This allows Lua I/O primitives to not be interrupted by Nginx's handling "
"of various signals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3784 a80df5fb849e4d4a968d64033ae5217a
msgid "This directive was first introduced in the `v0.10.14` release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3788 d974e7b184fe4cb8812535ecc4575877
msgid "lua_worker_thread_vm_pool_size"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3790 55caf81e7b7a476e9633222b7dbaa56a
msgid "**syntax:** *lua_worker_thread_vm_pool_size &lt;size&gt;*"
msgstr "**语法**：*lua_worker_thread_vm_pool_size &lt;size&gt;*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3792 97ff903eef7943838fd793110db8c91a
msgid "**default:** *lua_worker_thread_vm_pool_size 10*"
msgstr "**默认**：*lua_worker_thread_vm_pool_size 10*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3796 efe087fe4e0d478fa61cbcfcb16a82af
msgid ""
"Specifies the size limit of the Lua VM pool (default 100) that will be "
"used in the [ngx.run_worker_thread](#ngxrun_worker_thread) API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3798 e123d10272c0462cacd957498d525cac
msgid ""
"Also, it is not allowed to create Lua VMs that exceeds the pool size "
"limit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3800 86fd63853eb244fba784c231a6dc5b77
msgid "The Lua VM in the VM pool is used to execute Lua code in separate thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3802 600cfece6ac7483eaf0962bc16986279
msgid ""
"The pool is global at Nginx worker level. And it is used to reuse Lua VMs"
" between requests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:3804 0a66c5f9db0541cf8a24390db0e6094f
msgid ""
"**Warning:** Each worker thread uses a separate Lua VM and caches the Lua"
" VM for reuse in subsequent operations. Configuring too many worker "
"threads can result in consuming a lot of memory."
msgstr ""

