#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5283 7e6bdeaa708e4e338725a419a16fe413
msgid ""
"Keys and values are unescaped according to URI escaping rules. In the "
"settings above, `GET /test?a%20b=1%61+2` will yield:"
