msgid ""
"Clears the current request's request header named `header_name`. None of "
"the current request's existing subrequests will be affected but "
"subsequently initiated subrequests will inherit the change by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5612 1ffde18f9e264952b6f3de453694be6c
msgid "ngx.req.read_body"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5614 f1536884bf1647ecb57cb93939183a58
msgid "**syntax:** *ngx.req.read_body()*"
msgstr "**语法**：*ngx.req.read_body()*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5618 82f09e2bd533496ba34959fdae665bf0
msgid ""
"Reads the client request body synchronously without blocking the Nginx "
"event loop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5626 c50ef77b94af49ddba13805bc631b581
msgid ""
"If the request body is already read previously by turning on "
"[lua_need_request_body](#lua_need_request_body) or by using other "
"modules, then this function does not run and returns immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5628 60c2b2b8181b482d867587972ea7eafb
msgid ""
"If the request body has already been explicitly discarded, either by the "
"[ngx.req.discard_body](#ngxreqdiscard_body) function or other modules, "
"this function does not run and returns immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5630 10339d97879c4729a82bc850998f23d9
msgid ""
"In case of errors, such as connection errors while reading the data, this"
" method will throw out a Lua exception *or* terminate the current request"
" with a 500 status code immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5632 1b2fb3ff22434182b5ff280407d5c80f
msgid ""
"The request body data read using this function can be retrieved later via"
" [ngx.req.get_body_data](#ngxreqget_body_data) or, alternatively, the "
"temporary file name for the body data cached to disk using "
"[ngx.req.get_body_file](#ngxreqget_body_file). This depends on"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5634 65dab7d0e1514aa8acb04dbd6202eae5
msgid ""
"whether the current request body is already larger than the "
"[client_body_buffer_size](http://nginx.org/en/docs/http/ngx_http_core_module.html#client_body_buffer_size),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5635 1d7a1d09464d4d1e8e83295b06da52f1
msgid ""
"and whether "
"[client_body_in_file_only](http://nginx.org/en/docs/http/ngx_http_core_module.html#client_body_in_file_only)"
" has been switched on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5637 88833222f94b48039fe3802235fa00a4
msgid ""
"In cases where current request may have a request body and the request "
"body data is not required, The "
"[ngx.req.discard_body](#ngxreqdiscard_body) function must be used to "
"explicitly discard the request body to avoid breaking things under HTTP "
"1.1 keepalive or HTTP 1.1 pipelining."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5639 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5655
#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5685 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5709
#: 3e1e6b1a83b74b49b02dfd9b080f913c 61e15c80c7db49a890edccf8cde571db
#: 8e9678271dfd424b82f5ce9b28da688a a465a88bac164ed4b8594c0f79ffc3c4
msgid "This function was first introduced in the `v0.3.1rc17` release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5643 5d2c69825b9c4cefadd2aed1301732c0
msgid "ngx.req.discard_body"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5645 a2277c2e275d433b874d27ae1a111f71
msgid "**syntax:** *ngx.req.discard_body()*"
msgstr "**语法**：*ngx.req.discard_body()*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5649 bbef3996829c40e9883460d344dcc5f6
msgid ""
"Explicitly discard the request body, i.e., read the data on the "
"connection and throw it away immediately (without using the request body "
"by any means)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5651 03cbf17c0ee84e79bafd57b43af21413
msgid "This function is an asynchronous call and returns immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5653 271e4adf465a42969ab058265ae9d4be
msgid ""
"If the request body has already been read, this function does nothing and"
" returns immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5657 f8e69842210a4a0196bb487ceb22e700
msgid "See also [ngx.req.read_body](#ngxreqread_body)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5661 9e1bbb8cdd184452be1bcbf464d15ba6
msgid "ngx.req.get_body_data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5663 862ac38f2298463da781f8b65ac5a17f
msgid "**syntax:** *data = ngx.req.get_body_data(max_bytes?)*"
msgstr "**语法**：*data = ngx.req.get_body_data(max_bytes?)*"

