msgid ""
"**context:** *rewrite_by_lua&#42;, access_by_lua&#42;, "
"content_by_lua&#42;, log_by_lua&#42;*"
msgstr ""
"**上下文**：*rewrite_by_lua&#42;, access_by_lua&#42;, content_by_lua&#42;, "
"log_by_lua&#42;*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5667 5079744f30dd4c039a57c6ee1917600b
msgid ""
"Retrieves in-memory request body data. It returns a Lua string rather "
"than a Lua table holding all the parsed query arguments. Use the "
"[ngx.req.get_post_args](#ngxreqget_post_args) function instead if a Lua "
"table is required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5669 6004680d028348829551a2a806e41d7a
msgid ""
"The optional `max_bytes` argument can be used when you don't need the "
"entire body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5671 a7ea60bfa3b944a4a3590f5462e4ca4e
msgid "This function returns `nil` if"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5673 f265effcb9684cdfb087e318b4344569
msgid "the request body has not been read,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5674 5e01746564324fc49a93555137f609a1
msgid "the request body has been read into disk temporary files,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5675 68bcdbf2450641c3be33276175059dae
msgid "or the request body has zero size."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5677 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5701
#: 3e44587a59a44960bbcef78bfefb6ebf 8e81386142f74529ba13accdc3c39ab8
msgid ""
"If the request body has not been read yet, call "
"[ngx.req.read_body](#ngxreqread_body) first (or turn on "
"[lua_need_request_body](#lua_need_request_body) to force this module to "
"read the request body. This is not recommended however)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5679 90ec92d8cfe246429bf03c98601d1cfb
msgid ""
"If the request body has been read into disk files, try calling the "
"[ngx.req.get_body_file](#ngxreqget_body_file) function instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5681 529da3f4b634444b9acd8dd4dcd03712
msgid ""
"To force in-memory request bodies, try setting "
"[client_body_buffer_size](http://nginx.org/en/docs/http/ngx_http_core_module.html#client_body_buffer_size)"
" to the same size value in "
"[client_max_body_size](http://nginx.org/en/docs/http/ngx_http_core_module.html#client_max_body_size)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5683 6e4134aab6cd4b4c988d8a2c60daa9d6
msgid ""
"Note that calling this function instead of using `ngx.var.request_body` "
"or `ngx.var.echo_request_body` is more efficient because it can save one "
"dynamic memory allocation and one data copy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5687 d93e297561b24ffda5f579b18b46f07c
msgid "See also [ngx.req.get_body_file](#ngxreqget_body_file)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5691 4d4ecb44da10420694ffda70e42bc730
msgid "ngx.req.get_body_file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5693 0dbf72ac1ee1491c893b39779f5441fb
