msgstr "**语法**：*file_name = ngx.req.get_body_file()*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5697 bb1f145bd74547bc8b23572d2281aadb
msgid ""
"Retrieves the file name for the in-file request body data. Returns `nil` "
"if the request body has not been read or has been read into memory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5699 a93101303d024095865900cfa60d5a50
msgid ""
"The returned file is read only and is usually cleaned up by Nginx's "
"memory pool. It should not be manually modified, renamed, or removed in "
"Lua code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5703 19d650bc7a7f4dc8961e1751c4a5b43f
msgid ""
"If the request body has been read into memory, try calling the "
"[ngx.req.get_body_data](#ngxreqget_body_data) function instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5705 1a56aec235234752b7d42a9a798f9469
msgid ""
"To force in-file request bodies, try turning on "
"[client_body_in_file_only](http://nginx.org/en/docs/http/ngx_http_core_module.html#client_body_in_file_only)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5707 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5727
#: e1c9cee94a0948adb1623b0f6b20570e fa58b6e1a90b42d484545ffa5033735b
msgid ""
"Note that this function is also work for balancer phase but it needs to "
"call [balancer.recreate_request](https://github.com/openresty/lua-resty-"
"core/blob/master/lib/ngx/balancer.md#recreate_request) to make the change"
" take effect after set the request body data or headers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5711 ba35abbff03a40e7b1ea4fc12381005b
msgid "See also [ngx.req.get_body_data](#ngxreqget_body_data)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5715 90586b684e9d4b6b84b2970421bf086b
msgid "ngx.req.set_body_data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5717 75d570c2db2e4087b0aa2b729b1ee716
msgid "**syntax:** *ngx.req.set_body_data(data)*"
msgstr "**语法**：*ngx.req.set_body_data(data)*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5719 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5739
#: 1e9ed9aedf3c4ca98c61937d0079e3c7 3177d689e3784ba2ae655013fb6626a5
msgid ""
"**context:** *rewrite_by_lua&#42;, access_by_lua&#42;, "
"content_by_lua&#42;, balancer_by_lua&#42;,*"
msgstr ""
"**上下文**：*rewrite_by_lua&#42;, access_by_lua&#42;, content_by_lua&#42;, "
"balancer_by_lua&#42;,*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5721 b2c7c07cf268470ab1c9f155e698838b
msgid ""
"Set the current request's request body using the in-memory data specified"
" by the `data` argument."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5723 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5743
#: 6613f1d966db42c7a218af9789b08e3e edec1c11e087476e85f4746cfb7c5ec1
msgid ""
"If the request body has not been read yet, call "
"[ngx.req.read_body](#ngxreqread_body) first (or turn on "
"[lua_need_request_body](#lua_need_request_body) to force this module to "
"read the request body. This is not recommended however). Additionally, "
"the request body must not have been previously discarded by "
"[ngx.req.discard_body](#ngxreqdiscard_body)."
