#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5725 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:5749
#: 959ee58ff09542c2a1ed9804d51d683e dffef9ff2fd3470986708e3e004760f2
msgid ""
"Whether the previous request body has been read into memory or buffered "
"into a disk file, it will be freed or the disk file will be cleaned up "
"immediately, respectively."
