msgid "**requires:** `resty.core.base64` or `resty.core`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6401 fe47bab5f0be41d89a13bdfc2902785b
msgid ""
"Decodes the `str` argument as a base64 digest to the raw form. The `str` "
"follows base64 transfer encoding for MIME (RFC 2045), and will discard "
"characters outside the base encoding alphabet. Returns `nil` if `str` is "
"not well formed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6405 5abfde863ca94d5bbdb44b06f8fb0eac
msgid ""
"'''Note:''' This method requires the <code>resty.core.base64</code> or "
"<code>resty.core</code> modules from the [lua-resty-"
"core](https://github.com/openresty/lua-resty-core) library."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6409 7b46620e17ca476d9279da330b9268d0
msgid "ngx.crc32_short"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6411 af8b2fff624a43a8b5721877b49b042b
msgid "**syntax:** *intval = ngx.crc32_short(str)*"
msgstr "**语法**：*intval = ngx.crc32_short(str)*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6415 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6431
#: 97789899795d428da5069439a07e8ee9 9cd308bb37884ebebe5eeb39da2de875
msgid ""
"Calculates the CRC-32 (Cyclic Redundancy Code) digest for the `str` "
"argument."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6417 e00df502139f40a6aee86226a670cf14
msgid ""
"This method performs better on relatively short `str` inputs (i.e., less "
"than 30 ~ 60 bytes), as compared to [ngx.crc32_long](#ngxcrc32_long). The"
" result is exactly the same as [ngx.crc32_long](#ngxcrc32_long)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6419 634f579e4d2049f294822049c506ee2e
msgid ""
"Behind the scene, it is just a thin wrapper around the `ngx_crc32_short` "
"function defined in the Nginx core."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6421 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6437
#: 4a779d97107f4d33a21c4ece49ef10f4 7a335b8a78cb4b2899d14d740cdc3829
