"Computes the [HMAC-SHA1](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMAC) digest of "
"the argument `str` and turns the result using the secret key "
"`<secret_key>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6449 993207645b3043838ed3b54fb7b6ec78
msgid ""
"The raw binary form of the `HMAC-SHA1` digest will be generated, use "
"[ngx.encode_base64](#ngxencode_base64), for example, to encode the result"
" to a textual representation if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6461 ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6492
#: 3f58ca4b858a4e84b406f01df6782e92 67f3fa1baf0c4f6db81697b1be1a84ab
