msgid ""
"Returns the current time stamp (in the format `yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss`) of "
"the Nginx cached time (no syscall involved unlike Lua's "
"[os.date](https://www.lua.org/manual/5.1/manual.html#pdf-os.date) "
