msgid ""
"Returns a formatted string can be used as the http header time (for "
"example, being used in `Last-Modified` header). The parameter `sec` is "
"the time stamp in seconds (like those returned from "
"[ngx.time](#ngxtime))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:6644 b15c811063b7421dbc881828d10c7e9f
msgid "ngx.parse_http_time"
