msgstr "**语法**：*fd, err = tcpsock:getfd()*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:8086 34a1a1241b4540e7896868ff70e8ae90
msgid "Get the file descriptor of the current tcp socket."
msgstr ""

