"**syntax:** *hdl, err = ngx.timer.every(delay, callback, user_arg1, "
"user_arg2, ...)*"
msgstr ""
"**语法**：*hdl, err = ngx.timer.every(delay, callback, user_arg1, user_arg2,"
" ...)*"

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:9170 70f285222c3545e79427e1aa739064a8
msgid "Similar to the [ngx.timer.at](#ngxtimerat) API function, but"
msgstr ""

#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:9172 9ef8bbe328f34364a0613fcfdfc1c1eb
