#: ../../08-lua-nginx-module.md:9622 6b0dc271455a43c9a66e8b9f9c904a78
msgid ""
"The return values (res1, ...) are returned by invocation of the module "
"function. Normally, the `res1` should be in boolean type, so that the "
"caller could inspect the error."
msgstr ""

